### CeyGreen Student 2 — API samples
### Base URLs
@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@service = http://localhost:8081
@apiKey = ceygreen-dev-api-key

### ========== User Management (via gateway) ==========

### Register a farmer
POST {{gateway}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nimal Perera",
  "email": "nimal@ceygreen.test",
  "password": "greenhouse123",
  "role": "FARMER",
  "farmLocation": "Nuwara Eliya",
  "contactInfo": "+94771234567"
}

### Login — capture access_token from the response
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nimal@ceygreen.test",
  "password": "greenhouse123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}
@userId = {{login.response.body.user_id}}

### Get public profile
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update own profile
PUT {{gateway}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nimal K. Perera",
  "farmLocation": "Bandarawela",
  "contactInfo": "+94770000000"
}

### ========== Disease Detection (via gateway) ==========

### Upload a leaf image for diagnosis
POST {{gateway}}/api/diagnosis/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="leaf.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample-leaf.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="farmerId"

{{userId}}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cropType"

tomato
--WebAppBoundary--

### Get one diagnosis (replace DIAGNOSIS_ID)
GET {{gateway}}/api/diagnosis/DIAGNOSIS_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List diagnosis history for a farmer
GET {{gateway}}/api/diagnosis/history/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a diagnosis (replace DIAGNOSIS_ID)
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/diagnosis/DIAGNOSIS_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========== Negative cases ==========

### 401 — protected route without token
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/{{userId}}

### 401 — direct service call without API key (bypassing gateway)
GET {{service}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 403 — farmerId mismatch on upload
POST {{gateway}}/api/diagnosis/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="leaf.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample-leaf.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="farmerId"

00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cropType"

tomato
--WebAppBoundary--

### Direct service call WITH api key (standalone demo, no gateway)
GET {{service}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
